      "writtenOn": "2019-01-17T21:23:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you combine \"deps\" and \"cov\" into a single \"cov\" variation, which I think removes the need for resolveCoverageAndAddVariationDep?  Then dependency resolution is simple, because it\u0027s always \"cov\"-\u003e\"cov\", and use COVERAGE_PATHS to determine whether the \"cov\" variation builds with coverage.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "ec70def1d631087270ed90f9c8bbf63d7b34915f",
