      "writtenOn": "2019-02-06T18:11:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m kind of torn - your suggestion makes the code simpler.  But wouldn\u0027t it be easier to debug/troubleshoot if we explicitly differentiate between the two cases?  Else it may be confusing that a \u0027cov\u0027 variant does not build with coverage.",
